error[NK1131]: You can't give away `open.t` here: `open` is only borrowed.
   --> tests/door_field_handed_out_is_refused.nika:14:35
    |
 14 |     let got = m.access fn(open) { open.t }
    |                                   ^^^^^^
    |
    = note: `open` belongs to whoever lent it (a parameter without `keep`, a `for` over a list, a `let` over a place), and `open.t` is a `String`. Giving it away would take a piece out of something this function doesn't own.
    = help: Write `open.t.clone()` for a copy: a lambda hands back a value of its own.
